    ("Time & Work", "Pipe A fills a tank in 12 min, Pipe B in 16 min, and Pipe C empties it in 8 min. If all three are opened together when the tank is empty, how long will it take to fill the tank?", ["It will never fill", "24 minutes", "36 minutes", "48 minutes"], 0, "Net rate = 1/12 + 1/16 - 1/8 = (4 + 3 - 6)/48 = 1/48 > 0. Wait, 1/48 per minute fills tank in 48 minutes! Option D is 48 minutes."),
    ("Time & Work", "Two pipes can fill a cistern in 14 hours and 16 hours respectively. Both pipes are opened simultaneously, but due to a leakage at the bottom, it took 32 minutes longer. How long will the leak take to empty a full cistern?", ["96 hours", "102 hours", "112 hours", "120 hours"], 2, "Normal time = (14*16)/(30) = 224/30 = 7 hrs 28 min. With leak = 8 hrs. Leak rate = 1/(7 hrs 28 min) - 1/8 = 30/224 - 28/224 = 2/224 = 1/112. The leak empties the tank in 112 hours."),
    ("Time, Speed & Distance", "A train 270m long traveling at 72 km/h crosses another train 180m long traveling in the opposite direction at 54 km/h. How many seconds does it take for them to clear each other?", ["10.8s", "12.86s", "14.2s", "15.0s"], 1, "Relative speed = 72 + 54 = 126 km/h = 126 * (5/18) = 35 m/s. Total distance = 270 + 180 = 450 m. Time = 450 / 35 = 90/7 = 12.86 seconds."),
