    ("Numbers", "What is the HCF of 2/3, 8/9, 10/27, and 16/81?", ["2/81", "16/3", "2/3", "8/27"], 0, "HCF of fractions = (HCF of numerators) / (LCM of denominators) = HCF(2,8,10,16) / LCM(3,9,27,81) = 2 / 81."),
