    ("Mixture & Alligation", "A vessel contains 100 liters of wine. 20 liters are drawn off and replaced with water, and this action is repeated twice more. How much wine remains?", ["48.8 liters", "51.2 liters", "54.6 liters", "58.2 liters"], 1, "Remaining = 100 * (1 - 20/100)^3 = 100 * (0.8)^3 = 100 * 0.512 = 51.2 liters."),
    ("Mixture & Alligation", "In what ratio must an alloy containing 80% copper be mixed with an alloy containing 65% copper to obtain a resulting alloy of 70% copper?", ["1 : 2", "2 : 1", "1 : 3", "3 : 2"], 0, "By alligation: (70 - 65) : (80 - 70) = 5 : 10 = 1 : 2."),
