    ("Ratio & Proportion", "The ratio of boys to girls in a college is 7 : 8. If the percentage increase in boys and girls is 20% and 10% respectively, what will be the new ratio?", ["9 : 10", "18 : 21", "21 : 22", "23 : 24"], 2, "Boys = 70 * 1.20 = 84. Girls = 80 * 1.10 = 88. New ratio = 84 : 88 = 21 : 22."),
