    ("Permutation & Combination", "In how many ways can 5 gentlemen and 5 ladies sit around a round table so that no two gentlemen sit together?", ["2,880", "14,400", "28,800", "40,320"], 0, "Arrange 5 ladies in a circle in (5 - 1)! = 4! = 24 ways. There are 5 spaces between them for 5 gentlemen: 5! = 120 ways. Total = 24 * 120 = 2,880 ways."),
