    ("Probability", "A card is drawn from a well-shuffled pack of 52 cards. What is the probability that it is either a King or a Heart?", ["1/4", "4/13", "17/52", "9/26"], 1, "P(King) = 4/52. P(Heart) = 13/52. P(King of Hearts) = 1/52. P(King or Heart) = (4 + 13 - 1)/52 = 16/52 = 4/13."),
