    ("Time, Speed & Distance", "A man travels 360 km in 4 hours, partly by air and partly by train. If he had traveled entirely by air, he would have saved 4/5 of the train time and reached 2 hours earlier. Find the distance traveled by air.", ["240 km", "270 km", "300 km", "320 km"], 1, "Train time t_t, Air time t_a. t_t + t_a = 4. Time saved = (4/5)t_t = 2 hrs => t_t = 2.5 hrs. Air time = 4 - 2.5 = 1.5 hrs. Entire journey by air takes 4 - 2 = 2 hrs. Speed of air = 360 / 2 = 180 km/h. Air distance = 180 * 1.5 = 270 km."),
