    ("Direction Sense", "A man drives 8 km towards South, turns left and drives 6 km. What is the shortest straight-line distance back to his starting point?", ["10 km", "12 km", "14 km", "16 km"], 0, "By Pythagorean theorem: sqrt(8^2 + 6^2) = sqrt(64 + 36) = sqrt(100) = 10 km."),
